  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c5mPS5M.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STpZLUv.jpeg\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ribbits 將新增充滿名為 Ribbits 的小青蛙村民的沼澤村莊！<br>這些小傢伙有時會聚在一起演奏音樂，你也可以加入他們一起演奏！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;商人&nbsp;與漁夫 Ribbits 可以與他們交易各種物品，包含全新的 Ribbits 植物方塊 &amp; 沙鈴！<br>法師 Ribbits 偶爾會施放法術來增益玩家，&nbsp;以及&nbsp;所有園丁 Ribbits 都會為作物澆水！&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ribbits 到了晚上會自然返回家中，但如果你想遷移它們，可以用&nbsp;紫水晶&nbsp;右鍵點擊它們來將家點重置為目前位置。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術<br>yungnickyoung - 程式開發<br>HellionGames - 程式開發<br>scratchy_sd - 音效<br>wesleybenjamin - 音樂<br>joakota - 場景搭建<br>joshesque - 標誌設計<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 一款為 Minecraft 添加奇妙生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 一款添加多種友好動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong> - 為你的世界增添兩種友好的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Night Lights</a>&nbsp;- 添加了大量不同類型的裝飾性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a>&nbsp;- 為遊戲增添了 60 種全新近戰武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 一款徹底改造原版苦力怕的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 一款徹底改造原版終界使者的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a> </strong>- 一款添加了 9 種全新傀儡類型的模組！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BLLNBwE.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CgpcwIt.png\"></p>",
